  "prefLabel": "He-C 5004.11 Utilization Review and Control",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5004.11 Utilization Review and Control. The department’s program integrity unit shall monitor utilization of telehealth, including teledentistry services, to identify, prevent, and correct potential occurrences of fraud, waste, and abuse, in accordance with 42 CFR 455, CFR 456, and He-W 520.\n\nSource. #13651, eff 5-26-23",
